    <ListItem><Anchor Href="docs/common/data">Data and filters</Anchor>: the request, filters in code, fields and operators.</ListItem>
    <ListItem><Anchor Href="docs/common/data-api">Data from an API</Anchor>: calling your own API, filters as text, and OData.</ListItem>
